My assessment of the Trentmoor Wickham application, unvarnished.<br />
<br />
On the three claims we tried, we are fine. The Division had a reasonable ba=
sis in law and fact, and substantial justification does not require that we=
 win.<br />
<br />
On the two claims we dropped in December, I would not want to be arguing it=
. We pleaded them on a document review that we later understood differently=
, and we dropped them the week after the document custodian was deposed. Ha=
lstead will say we should have understood the documents before we pleaded, =
and there is a version of that sentence I cannot answer.<br />
<br />
The rates are high but within what the Commission has allowed where the sta=
tutory cap is exceeded for specialized expertise, and I do not think fighti=
ng the rates is where the value is. Expect an award on the two dropped clai=
ms and expect the adjudicator to prorate.<br />
